 //   Player row (permission "media", Clicktrough): what the plugin plays, shown with its controls
 //   in a row under the meter's header while anything plays; a control there comes as an event:
 //   await a2.media.set({ icon: "tv", title, sub, paused, muted, volume: 0..1, opacity: 0.2..1,
